 # Shoe repair
 
-Collection tickets for Pryce & Daughter, shoe repairs and key cutting on Bridge Street. `data/jobs.json` lists the jobs on the rack: the ticket number, the customer, the job (`heels`, `stitching` or `resole`) and the day the shoes came in.
+Collection tickets for Pryce & Daughter, shoe repairs and key cutting on Bridge Street. `data/jobs.json` lists the jobs on the rack: the ticket number, the customer, the job (`heels`, `stitching` or `resole`), the day the shoes came in and the initials of whoever is doing the work.
 
 ## Tickets
 
-When shoes come in, the counter prints a collection ticket for the customer, one line per job.
+When shoes come in, the counter prints a collection ticket for the customer, one line per job, with the initials of whoever is doing it.
+
+## Opening days
+
+The shop is open Tuesday to Saturday. It is shut on Sundays and Mondays and on the dates in `data/closed.json` (bank holidays and the Christmas break). `src/hours.mjs` is the one place that knows when the shop is open; the door sign is printed from it.
 
 ## Usage
 
 ```
 npm run tickets   # the tickets for the jobs on the rack
+npm run sign      # the door sign for the coming fortnight
 npm test
 ```
 
